{"version":1,"key":"quest:17","content":{"id":17,"title":"原型链是什么？为什么要有原型链？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:17","type":"quest","id":17},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"原型链机制与 instanceof 实现原理","meta":"","excerpt":"原型链是 JavaScript 实现继承的一种机制，当访问一个对象上不存在的属性时，会从它的原型上去查找。每一个对象上都存在一个 prototype 属性，指向的就是其原型对象，原型对象上也存在 prototype，可以发现，通过 prototype 形成了一条链表，这个通过 prototype 形成的链表称为原型链，","target":{"key":"card:587","type":"card","id":587},"citeKey":"card:587"}],"trail":[{"time":1744701080876,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1745405642924,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1745405642924,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1744701080876,"updateTime":1744701080876,"resolvedTime":1745405642924},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1744701080876}}